I
800
OBJ

# A file laid out by an add-on exporter that appends a `#` comment to every
# record: vertex indices after each VT row, a note on TRIS.  The tail is not in
# the OBJ8 spec but the sim ignores it, so the importer has to as well.
TEXTURE comments.png
TEXTURE_LIT comments_LIT.png
TEXTURE_NORMAL comments_NM.png
NORMAL_METALNESS
GLOBAL_specular 1
POINT_COUNTS 4 0 0 6

VT -1 0 -1 0 1 0 0 1 # 0
VT 1 0 -1 0 1 0 1 1 # 1
VT 1 0 1 0 1 0 1 0 # 2
VT -1 0 1 0 1 0 0 0 # 3
IDX10 0 1 2 0 2 3 # quad, clockwise

ATTR_poly_os 1 # coplanar decal
TRIS 0 6 # two triangles, nothing else

# end of file
